    /// ASM loc_F25C (kid.asm:19832): the visible shooter pass derives the
    /// block-space camera window from `Camera_X/Y_pos`, seeds the sprite link
    /// word as `$0500 | Number_Sprites`, and only scans when `$FFFFF8C2` is set.
